    "detailed_description": "<h1>** IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT NOV 13 , 2021 **</h1><p>After such a fantastic reception and an outpouring of support, we've decided to create a new story utilizing all the valuable feedback from our audience.  &quot;The Cult of Chanseville&quot; is the sequel to our first short survival horror game, &quot;Understanding, the Game.&quot; <br><br>NEW STORE LINK --&gt;  CLICK HERE!  -- <u><strong>NEW DEMO COMING SOON!!</strong></u><br><br>(The Cult of Chanseville) is a twisted adventure into the deepest, darkest secrets that haunt the city.<br><br>Both the good and bad reviews helped me a lot in making this decision ... we really thank everyone who played this little game from the bottom of our hearts!<br><br>- I apologize for the glitches / problems that the game presented and people are still very supportive<br><br>many thanks to the<br><br>720,000+ people who visited the store.<br><br>50,000+ additions to the library<br><br>9000+ additions to the wish list!<br><br>I really have no way of thanking you all! see you soon ;)<br><br>**THIS GAME IS NOT MORE IN DEVELOPMENT, WE INVITE YOU TO PLAY OUR NEW DEMO &quot;The Cult of Chanseville&quot; THANKS EVERYONE FOR ALL THE SUPPORT DURING THIS YEAR**</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>** IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT N\u00b03 : ** Important Announcement PROJECT STATUS &amp;&amp; ROAD TO EVA!!  &lt;--- click here<br><br>** IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT N\u00b02 : ** 617.000 THANKS! , NEWS &amp;&amp; PROJECT STATUS** 28 APRIL  &lt;--- click here<br><br>** IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT : **DEMO HOTFIX** 7 JANUARY  &lt;--- click here<br>                                               <br>OFFICIAL GAME INSTAGRAM : @matygex_games<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY / COMO JUGAR :</h2></strong><br><br>********RIGHT CLICK = USE KEYS ON DOORS********<br>F11 = FULL SCREEN / NO FULL SCREEN<br>Left Mouse Button = Use<br>F = Flashlight<br>SHIFT = Run.<br>W, A, S, D = Movement<br>Right Mouse Button = Use Keys on doors,<br>Knoc 